OL,3,GNEWSAHarry and Meghan arrive in
OL,4,ANottingham to cheering crowds in first
OL,5,Ajoint tour since UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex have
OL,8,Farrived in Nottingham to cheers from a
OL,9,Fcrowd of hundreds on their first
OL,10,Froyal-style joint engagement since
OL,11,Freturning to the UK
OL,13,FThe first stop is outside the Community
OL,14,FRecording Studio (CRS) charity, a place
OL,15,FHarry has a long relationship with,
OL,16,Fbefore the couple visit two more
OL,17,Flocations
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
